      "implied_sd_bad_body": "— no published instrument looks like this. SEM = SD√(1−r), so this reliability and this SEM together require a score scale far wider than any test uses. The interval below is arithmetically correct and describes a test that cannot exist: raise the reliability or lower the SEM.",
