      "rigid_solids_transmit_sound_fastest_be": "Rigid solids transmit sound fastest because atoms are tightly packed and bonded. You can hear a train coming by putting your ear to the rail long before you hear it through air!",
      "robot_vacuum_cleaners_and_drones_use_u": "Robot vacuum cleaners and drones use ultrasonic rangefinders to navigate. Engineers study bat flight algorithms to improve autonomous navigation in cluttered environments.",
