      "visual_flowchart_showing_the_11_studen": "Visual flowchart showing the 11 student modules organized by conceptual scale (alleles → populations → species → all of life). Includes Quick / Standard / Deep-dive learning paths.",
      "wallace_co_discovered_selection_but_da": "Wallace co-discovered selection but Darwin gets the credit. Franklin's data unlocked DNA but Watson and Crick got the Nobel. Margulis and McClintock did paradigm-shifting work despite being marginalized. The textbook story tends to compress messy history into \"hero scientists\" — the messier reality is more interesting and more honest.",
