      "specific_weights_calorie_numbers_bmi_n": "specific weights, calorie numbers, BMI numbers, descriptions of restrictive behaviors, \"before/after\" framing, or any content that could function as a how-to. The information is intentionally general — focused on awareness, support, and recovery.",
      "spectrum_of_disordered_eating_signs_to": "Spectrum of disordered eating, signs to watch for, online content red flags + algorithm-awareness, how to support a friend, what to do if it's you, recovery paths. NEDA + Surgeon General sourced. Gated by content warning.",
